<title>USA: U.S. coffee imports - Commerce.</title>
<headline>U.S. coffee imports - Commerce.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Commerce Department report of unroasted, roasted and soluble coffee imports.</p>
<p> (Tonnes):    Dec96    Nov96    Dec95</p>
<p> Unroasted  109,707   89,115   93,751</p>
<p> Roasted	2,628    1,976    1,579</p>
<p> Soluble	2,419    1,500    2,062</p>
<p>Soluble</p>
<p> from Brazil  1,070	367	654</p>
<p>Note - Coffees include decaffeinated and nondecaffeinated. Soluble includes instant and nonflavored, plus extracts, essences and concentrates.</p>
</text>
